 "#D9E0E4", "__globals__": {"background_color": "globals/colors?id=gdsurf", "border_color": "globals/colors?id=gdborder"}, "width": {"unit": "%", "size": 48}, "width_mobile": {"unit": "%", "size": 100}}, "elements": [{"id": "ecf80d6", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "settings": {"editor": "<p><strong><a href=\"/grooming-an-anxious-dog/\">Grooming a dog who hates being groomed</a></strong></p><p>If nail trims are a battle, start here.</p>"}, "elements": []}], "isInner": true}, {"id": "66e8ab0", "elType": "container", "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "flex_gap": {"unit": "px", "size": 8, "column": "8", "row": "8", "isLinked": true}, "padding": {"unit": "px", "top": "24", "right": "24", "bottom": "24", "left": "24", "isLinked": true}, "padding_mobile": {"unit": "px", "top": "16", "right": "16", "bottom": "16", "left": "16", "isLinked": true}, "border_radius": {"unit": "px", "top": "8", "right": "8", "bottom": "8", "left": "8", "isLinked": true}, "background_background": "classic", "background_color": "#FFFFFF", "border_border": "solid", "border_width": {"unit": "px", "top": "1", "right": "1", "bottom": "1", "left": "1", "isLinked": true}, "border_color": "#D9E0E4", "__globals__": {"background_color": "globals/colors?id=gdsurf", "border_color": "globals/colors?id=gdborder"}, "width": {"unit": "%", "size": 48}, "width_mobile": {"unit": "%", "size": 100}}, "elements": [{"id": "931c943", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "settings": {"editor": "<p><strong><a href=\"/dog-grooming-tools/\">Grooming tools</a></strong></p><p>Choosing clippers or a grinder.</p>"}, "elements": []}], "isInner": true}, {"id": "2fa3561", "elType": "container", "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "flex_gap": {"unit": "px", "size": 8, "column": "8", "row": "8", "isLinked": true}, "padding": {"unit": "px", "top": "24", "right": "24", "bottom": "24", "left": "24", "isLinked": true}, "padding_mobile": {"unit": "px", "top": "16", "right": "16", "bottom": "16", "left": "16", "isLinked": true}, "border_radius": {"unit": "px", "top": "8", "right": "8", "bottom": "8", "left": "8", "isLinked": true}, "background_background": "classic", "background_color": "#FFFFFF", "border_border": "solid", "border_width": {"unit": "px", "top": "1", "right": "1", "bottom": "1", "left": "1", "isLinked": true}, "border_color": "#D9E0E4", "__globals__": {"background_color": "globals/colors?id=gdsurf", "border_color": "globals/colors?id=gdborder"}, "width": {"unit": "%", "size": 48}, "width_mobile": {"unit": "%", "size": 100}}, "elements": [{"id": "8b1c0df", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "settings": {"editor": "<p><strong><a href=\"/senior-dog-grooming/\">Senior dog grooming</a></strong></p><p>Nail care for older dogs.</p>"}, "elements": []}], "isInner": true}], "isInner": true}, {"id": "40fd028", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "settings": {"editor": "<p>This is general information about grooming healthy dogs, not veterinary advice. If a nail is broken or torn, a toe is swollen, or bleeding won't stop, contact your vet. <a href=\"/editorial-policy/\">How we write, source and fund our guides</a>.</p>", "text_color": "#5B6870", "__globals__": {"typography_typography": "globals/typography?id=accent", "text_color": "globals/colors?id=secondary"}}, "elements": []}, {"id": "5f092bb", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "settings": {"editor": "<p class=\"gd-label\" id=\"sources\"><strong>Sources</strong></p>\n<ul class=\"gd-sources\"><li id=\"s1\"><span class=\"gd-src-label\">[1]</span> Harriet Meyers, American Kennel Club: \"How to Trim Your Dog's Nails Safely\", published September 29, 2022, updated June 1, 2026. <a href=\"https://www.akc.org/expert-advice/health/how-to-trim-dogs-nails-safely/\">https://www.akc.org/expert-advice/health/how-to-trim-dogs-nails-safely/</a></li><li id=\"s2\"><span class=\"gd-src-label\">[2]</span> AKC Staff, American Kennel Club: \"How to Groom Your Dog at Home: Easy Tips for Everyday Care\", updated September 2, 2026. <a href=\"https://www.akc.org/expert-advice/health/how-to-groom-a-dog/\">https://www.akc.org/expert-advice/health/how-to-groom-a-dog/</a></li><li id=\"s3\"><span class=\"gd-src-label\">[3]</span> VCA Animal Hospitals (content by LifeLearn Animal Health): \"Handling Exercises for Trimming Nails and Brushing Teeth\", © 2023. <a href=\"https://vcahospitals.com/know-your-pet/handling-exercises-for-trimming-nails-and-brushing-teeth\">https://vcahospitals.com/know-your-pet/handling-exercises-for-trimming-nails-and-brushing-teeth</a></li><li id=\"s4\"><span class=\"gd-src-label\">[4]</span> ASPCA: \"At-Home Pet Grooming: Top Tips and Recommendations\", April 9, 2020. <a href=\"https://www.aspca.org/news/home-pet-grooming-top-tips-and-recommendations\">https://www.aspca.org/news/home-pet-grooming-top-tips-and-recommendations</a></li><li id=\"s5\"><span class=\"gd-src-label\">[5]</span> Toronto Humane Society: \"Trimming your Dog's Nails\" (PDF, June 2021). <a href=\"https://www.torontohumanesociety.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/10/Trimming-Your-Dogs-Nails.pdf\">https://www.torontohumanesociety.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/10/Trimming-Your-Dogs-Nails.pdf</a></li><li id=\"s6\"><span class=\"gd-src-label\">[6]</span> Humane World for Animals: \"How to groom your dog at home\" (undated). <a href=\"https://www.humaneworld.org/en/resources/how-groom-your-dog-home\">https://www.humaneworld.org/en/resources/how-groom-your-dog-home</a></li></ul>", "text_color": "#5B6870", "__globals__": {"typography_typography": "globals/typography?id=accent", "text_color": "globals/colors?id=secondary"}}, "elements": []}], "isInner": false}]